#   doc/  qsys_tcl/  script/  syn/<project files>  tb_int/<test sources>
#   .gitignore  README.md  top.vhd  top.qpf  top.qip
#
# Regeneratable / archival (never committed):
generated/
trash_bin/
tb_int/trash_bin/

# Quartus / Qsys build outputs
**/db/
**/qdb/
**/incremental_db/
**/output_files/
**/sta_debug_*/
**/timing_debug/
**/*.sof
**/*.pof
**/*.jic
**/*.rpt
**/*.qws
**/*.log
**/*.smsg
**/*.cmp
**/qverify_*/
**/generated/tmp/

# Simulator work products
**/work_*/
**/transcript
**/vsim.wlf
**/*.vcd

# Tooling scratch
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
